decision-tree-prompt.md

# The horizon photograph used to be ignored, on the reasoning that it was a
# local choice rather than something the repo ships. It is a deliberate part
# of the design now, so it has to be committed — an ignored file is not on the
# deployment, and the page would fall back to the drawn ridgelines there while
# looking right on the machine that chose it.

